{"products":[{"id":14834708709725,"title":"Sun Ice","handle":"sun-ice","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSun Ice est une fragrance gourmande, florale et fruitée, qui évoque la douceur sucrée d’une journée ensoleillée et le plaisir rafraîchissant d’un dessert glacé. Les notes de tête pétillantes de cassis et de bergamote d’Italie apportent une fraîcheur lumineuse, comme une brise estivale. En son cœur, la pomme croquante, la pistache grillée, le toffee caramélisé et l’héliotrope doux créent un mélange gourmand et irrésistible. Le fond révèle une base boisée et chaleureuse, avec du cèdre de Virginie, de la vanille de Tahiti, du musc, de la fève de tonka, du santal et de l’ambre, qui prolonge cette étreinte sucrée et sophistiquée.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-07-03T11:53:16+02:00","created_at":"2024-12-09T14:03:22+01:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T20:01:27+02:00","vendor":"Librery","product_type":"","tags":["Apothicaire"],"variants":[{"id":55553911488861,"title":"100ML","option1":"100ML","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"0","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"198.00","grams":0,"compare_at_price":null,"position":3,"product_id":14834708709725,"created_at":"2025-01-01T22:19:01+01:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T20:01:27+02:00"},{"id":55553911521629,"title":"2ML","option1":"2ML","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"7.00","grams":0,"compare_at_price":null,"position":4,"product_id":14834708709725,"created_at":"2025-01-01T22:19:01+01:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T20:01:27+02:00"}],"images":[{"id":71772544663901,"created_at":"2024-12-09T14:02:33+01:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2024-12-09T14:02:36+01:00","product_id":14834708709725,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0911\/1594\/6333\/files\/SunIce.png?v=1733749356","width":2000,"height":2000},{"id":71772544696669,"created_at":"2024-12-09T14:02:33+01:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2024-12-09T14:02:37+01:00","product_id":14834708709725,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0911\/1594\/6333\/files\/SunIcevisu.png?v=1733749357","width":2000,"height":2000},{"id":71772544729437,"created_at":"2024-12-09T14:03:08+01:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2024-12-09T14:03:11+01:00","product_id":14834708709725,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0911\/1594\/6333\/files\/Sun_package_librery.png?v=1733749391","width":2000,"height":2000}],"options":[{"name":"Format","position":1,"values":["100ML","2ML"]}]},{"id":14834692555101,"title":"Hot Sand","handle":"hot-sand","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHot Sand est une symphonie gourmande et raffinée qui évoque la chaleur sensuelle d’un coucher de soleil sur une plage dorée. Les premières notes délicates d’eau de jasmin et d’orchidée rappellent la douceur de l’air marin mêlé à des fleurs exotiques. Elles laissent place à un cœur savoureux et addictif, où la ganache de chocolat blanc, la crème chantilly et le lait d’amande composent un véritable délice olfactif. En fond, le cèdre robuste, le santal crémeux et le musc blanc forment une base enveloppante, chaude et réconfortante. Hot Sand, c’est le mariage parfait entre l’opulence gourmande et la sophistication\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-01-04T13:11:34+01:00","created_at":"2024-12-09T14:00:07+01:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T20:01:27+02:00","vendor":"Librery","product_type":"","tags":[],"variants":[{"id":55553874755933,"title":"100ML","option1":"100ML","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"198.00","grams":500,"compare_at_price":null,"position":3,"product_id":14834692555101,"created_at":"2025-01-01T22:17:33+01:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T20:01:27+02:00"},{"id":55553874788